eloid leukemia-derived K-562 cell line after 48-hour exposure, as assessed by the MTT-dye reduction assay. Each data point represents the mean &#x000b1; SD (<italic>n</italic> &#x02265; 6).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MBD2007-15925.007"/></fig><fig id="F8" position="float"><label>Figure 8</label><caption><p>Cytotoxic effect of <chem-struct>Dy(NO<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub> &#x000b7; 5H<sub>2</sub>O</chem-struct> on the chronic myeloid leukemia-derived K-562 cell line after 48-hour exposure, as assessed by the MTT-dye reduction assay. Each data point represents the mean &#x000b1; SD (<italic>n</italic> &#x02265; 6).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MBD2007-15925.008"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Elemental analysis of <chem-struct>Ln(III)</chem-struct> complexes ofcoumarin-3-carboxilic acid. <chem-struct>HCCA = C<sub>10</sub>H<sub>6</sub>O<sub>4</sub></chem-struct>; <chem-struct>CCA = C<sub>10</sub>H<sub>5</sub>O<sub>4</sub><sup>&#x02212;</sup></chem-struct>.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Compound</td><td align="center" colspan="5" rowspan="1">Calculated/found (%)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Formulae</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><chem-struct>C</chem-struct></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><chem-struct>H</chem-struct></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><chem-struct>N</chem-struct></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><chem-struct>H<sub>2</sub>O</chem-struct></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><chem-struct>Ln</chem-struct></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" colspan="1"><chem-struct>Sm(CCA)<sub>2</sub>(NO<sub>3</sub>) &#x000b7; H<sub>2</sub>O</chem-struct></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">39,47/</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1,97/</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" 